      "cooked": "<p>Ha! <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> “Ross”. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> And apparently you’re “Joseph Gordon-Levitt with a beard”? (Pretty sure that wasn’t refering to me…)</p>\n<p>We may need name badges with titles for future cons.  8)</p>\n<p>Very glad to hear they enjoyed the game, though!</p>",
