      "created_at": "2012-06-18T12:39:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I promise you it will be mentioned in another podcast on 6/26, too. The site I write for (Snackbar Games) is mostly video game oriented, but after E3 our managing editor thought it would be nice to unplug for a bit so that will be the topic for our next podcast (recording on Sunday). I think he even invited the DiceHateMe guy (Chris Kirkham) to be on it as a guest, since he’s local (Chris, our ME, and I all live in central North Carolina).</p>\n<p>I’m not sure what I’m going to say about it yet, but I’m almost certain it will come up naturally.</p>",
